"1zqbbm3y1021": {
"body": "On November 13th, Mailgun incorrectly rejected a subset of inbound emails with a 550 \"recipient rejected\" error. Senders received bounce notifications even though delivery should have succeeded.\n\nAffected timeframes:\nUS region: 05:14 to 06:41 UTC and 14:55 to 15:48 UTC\nEU region: 14:55 to 15:48 UTC\n\nBased on our analysis, approximately 25% of US inbound traffic and 50% of EU inbound traffic had a chance to have been impacted during these windows. We're unable to provide exact counts due to gaps in our logging for rejected inbound mail, which we have since corrected.",
"first_seen": "2026-09-04T07:16:22Z",
"impact": "none",
